flowchart LR
  F{{"component left<br/>at this level?"}}
  F -->|yes| D["<b>Descend</b><br/>cache lookup; on a miss<br/>decide and propagate"]
  D -->|no conflict| F
  D -->|conflict| A["analyse conflict,<br/>learn a clause"]
  F -->|no| U["<b>Ascend</b><br/>add the two branches,<br/>cache, multiply into parent"]
  A --> U
  U -->|stack not empty| F
  U -->|stack empty| X([total count])

  classDef big fill:#e8eef6,stroke:#4673aa
  classDef bad fill:#f8e2e2,stroke:#c83c3c
  classDef term fill:#e6f2e3,stroke:#59a14f
  class D,U big
  class A bad
  class X term
